<title>UK: Salomon sets call warrants on two U.S companies.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets call warrants on two U.S companies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers AG said it has issued five million American-style call warrants each on shares of McDonald's Corp and Gillette Co.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	24.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES/STUT	   MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	STRIKE	ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> MCDONALDS    $42.50	2.32 DEM  13.30 PCT  5.97 TIMES</p>
<p> GILLETTE     $80.00	3.20 DEM  13.22 PCT  7.84 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
